  "question": {
    "text": "An ideal gas undergoes a cyclic process as shown in the figure<br /><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/cbaca9f6-079e-4650-b86c-c7e7a655544b-image.png\" style=\"width: 250px; height: 197px;\" /><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8710;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">U</mi><mi>BC</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><msup><mi>KJmol</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>,</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">q</mi><mi>AB</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>KJmol</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">W</mi><mi>AB</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><msup><mi>KJmol</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>,</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">W</mi><mi>CA</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>KJmol</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi></math><br /><br />Heat absorbed by the system during process <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>CA</mi><mo>&#160;</mo></math>is",
