  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>AB</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></math> isobaric<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>BC</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></math> isochoric<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>CA</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></math> not defined</p><p>For cyclic process,&nbsp;&Delta;U=0<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8710;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">U</mi><mi>AB</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">q</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">W</mi></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8710;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">U</mi><mi>ABC</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8710;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">U</mi><mi>AB</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mo>&#8710;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">U</mi><mi>BC</mi></msub></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi>KJ</mi></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8710;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">U</mi><mi>CA</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Q</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">W</mi></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>8</mn><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Q</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Q</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi>kJ</mi></math></p><p>Therefore, the heat absorbed by the system during process&nbsp;CA&nbsp;is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>KJmol</mi><mrow><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math>.</p>",
